PARSFILE
#FullDataName Models: Self-Contained Solvers`Simple C Wrapper Program`Run with Custom Wrapper Program
#RingCtrl1 2
OPT_INT_METHOD 2
#CheckBox0 0    
*USE_DIFF_SOLVERS 0
#CheckBox1 1    
*USE_WRAPPER 1
#CheckBox2 0    
OPT_IO_UPDATE 0
#CheckBox3 0    

*WRAPPER Extensions\Custom_C\solver_simple\solver_simple.exe
LIVE_SERVER_UPDATE_FREQ_MAX 60

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This identifies a compiled C program "solver_simple.exe" that will read the file "SIMFILE.SIM", load the VS solver for the vehicle configuration specified on the Run Control screen, and make the run.
#
#The C program is described in a tech memo accessed from Help > Technical Memos > Example: Automating Runs with the VS API.
#
#The 32/64-bit selection is made automatically for this example; the setting on this screen is ignored.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

LOG_ENTRY Used Dataset: Models: Self-Contained Solvers; { Run with Custom Wrapper Program } Simple C Wrapper Program
